// The debug world set's game stations: the catalog every station of the set offers and where each one stands. A module
// library: game-station-root.puck stands one station alone and the gallery's board game room stands its own
// (gallery/gallery.puck), both over the standard's game station (../standard/game-station.puck).

// The catalog, in the order the glass lists it: chess, then the two patience games, each a game of its own as the shape
// catalog lists each exhibit as its own row.
let gameStationCatalog = [
  { id: "chess", title: "CHESS" }
  { id: "klondike", title: "KLONDIKE" }
  { id: "freecell", title: "FREECELL" }
]

// The station the isolated root stands: at the origin, its creation's floor on the root's floor.
let rootStation = { id: "station", at [0, -0.5, 0] }
